    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d98">

                <pb facs="0152" n="68" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp02/pg68"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72114/3455a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé in Switzerland</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Wilson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1164</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-02-21">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 21, 1918</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The Department encloses herewith, for
                    transmission to the Imperial German Foreign Office through the good offices of
                    the Spanish Legation in Berne and the Spanish Embassy at Berlin, copies of a
                    “Draft of Proposed Informal Arrangement between the United States and Germany
                    Regarding the Treatment and Privileges of Prisoners of War.”</p>
                <p>Before forwarding the enclosed draft to the German Government, the Department
                    desires that you examine the contents thereof with great care. If you consider
                    it advisable to make any important changes therein, you are instructed to cable
                    to the Department for authorization to make such changes.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d98-a1.xml" xpointer="d98-a1"/>
            </div>
